# Learned rules

Scan this table before acting. Use a row when its **Scope** matches the task (or scope is `agent`).

Hard rules in `docs/PRODUCT.md` and `.cursor/rules/scoresense-core.mdc` beat this table.

## How to apply frequency

| Freq | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| `always` | Do this whenever the condition is true. No silent skip. |
| `never` | Do not do this. No silent exception. |
| `usually` | Default. If you deviate, say why in the reply. |
| `rarely` | Do not do this unless the user asked this turn or a hard rule requires it. |

## Catalog

Keep under 30 data rows. Promote `always` / `never` into `docs/PRODUCT.md` or a domain `.mdc` and delete the row. Do not invent rows here except via `.cursor/skills/capture-correction/SKILL.md`.

